  "purpose": "Define a deterministic, creation-only episode-collapse policy for overlapping AVol zones without reading future prices or silently changing the analysis denominator.",
  "economic_justification": "Collapsing dependent overlapping zones before outcomes prevents one market episode from being counted repeatedly and overstating effective sample size or apparent edge.",
  "how_it_can_be_refuted": "Reject the policy if episode membership changes with input order, links zones across forbidden partitions, depends on first touch or future prices, creates more than one primary anchor, or cannot reproduce membership from the frozen creation store and policy hash.",
